  "body": "To download the property documents use the following link: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/MB62\r\n\r\nThe wedding is over, the celebrations are done, and now our owners are seriously motivated to see this beautiful home sold.\r\n\r\nWith their daughter recently married, family life has understandably been focused on the big day. Now their attention has turned firmly back to the property, creating a fantastic opportunity to secure one of the most unique homes you'll find in Red Beach.\r\n\r\nOriginally built circa 1914 and lovingly relocated from Grey Lynn to its elevated setting, this beautifully restored villa combines genuine character and charm with modern family living, all on a full 758sqm (more or less) freehold site.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you arrive, it feels special. Ornate pressed ceilings, polished rimu floors, wide hallways, traditional sash windows and a wonderful wraparound veranda showcase the craftsmanship of another era.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen and bathrooms have been beautifully updated, while four generous bedrooms include a master with ensuite. The fourth bedroom offers flexibility as a second lounge or media room, plus there's a separate study for working from home.\r\n\r\nFrench doors open onto a sun-soaked entertaining deck, with established gardens and level lawns offering plenty of room for children, pets and summer entertaining. Positioned approximately 60 metres down a private driveway and well back from the road, there's a genuine sense of peace and privacy, plus extensive under-house storage.\r\n\r\nMorning coffee on the veranda, birdsong in the garden or a glass of wine at the end of the day, this is a home that encourages you to slow down and enjoy where you live.\r\n\r\nKingsWay School, Silverdale Shopping Centre, Northern Arena, public transport, Orewa Beach and the estuary walkways are all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nFinding a genuine character villa is difficult enough in central Auckland. Finding one in Red Beach on a full site with this much character, space and privacy is something very special.\r\n\r\nThe celebrations are complete, our owners are motivated, and this beautiful home is ready for its next chapter.",
